# Project — Go Backend Architecture

## Module root
- Go module at **repo root** (`go.mod`, `main.go` at the top level — no `app/` wrapper folder)
- All paths below are relative to the **repo root**

## Stack
- gin-gonic, PostgreSQL via GORM
- **Auth:** bearer **JWT** validated in **middleware**; provider-specific logic in **`infrastructure/auth`** (pluggable adapter surface). Default implementation: **Supabase** (JWKS ES256).
- Config via **Viper** + env vars (`config/`)
- Prefer modern Go patterns; format with gofmt; use gosimple / govet

## Architecture: DB model → Service → Application (optional) → Controller

```
├── main.go
├── application/           # Orchestration — transport-agnostic use cases (multi-service flows); no gin
├── controllers/           # HTTP — gin handlers, DTOs, requests, mappers
│   ├── common/            # Shared context helpers (GetUserContextOrAbort, etc.)
│   ├── health/            # /ping, /version probes
│   └── v1/                # Versioned API handlers (e.g. v1/me/)
├── services/              # Business logic — domain models, mappers, GORM / external APIs
├── database/
│   ├── model/             # GORM table mirrors (incl. model/i18n/ when needed)
│   ├── db.go              # DB connection singleton
│   └── init.sql           # Initial schema script (manual migrations)
├── router/
│   └── router.go          # Route registration (group paths sorted alphabetically)
├── middleware/            # Auth, user provisioning, context, body limit, etc.
├── infrastructure/        # Identity provider adapters (Supabase), other external integrations
│   └── auth/
│       ├── auth.go        # Provider interface + normalized Claims
│       ├── registry/      # Provider selection from JWT iss
│       └── provider/      # Supabase (default), other IdPs
├── config/                # Env-based configuration (App, DB, Logger sub-configs)
├── commons/
│   ├── helpers/           # Loggers, ResponseJSON, ShouldBindJSON, pagination
│   ├── lib/               # JSONB, pointers, validation, bucket URL helpers
│   └── constants/         # Cross-cutting constants (context keys, version, etc.)
├── log/                   # Bootstrap: logging levels from config (uses commons/helpers)
└── datatransfers/         # Generic JSON envelopes (optional — prefer commons/helpers)
```

## Global conventions
- `context.Context` always first parameter
- Use `int64` for IDs, counters, business keys (not uint/uint64) unless DB compatibility forces otherwise
- File naming: `snake_case.go`
- Exported: `PascalCase` — unexported: `camelCase` — constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`
- All code comments in **English** only
- Document public functions: `// FunctionName does...`
- No commented-out dead code — delete it
- Router paths sorted alphabetically in `router.go`
